++## Example Ready Prompts
++- Agent Hierarchy: Queen central with tiers (Front-Door, Leadership, Specialist...) as orbiting elegant nodes, chibi accents on lower tiers.
++- SIP Layers + Queen: 10 universal IS as glowing constellation around Queen.
++- Memory Palace: 6 vaults as 3D orbs with Queen architecting.
